____</p>
<p align=3D"center"> <em><strong>Closing comment</strong></em> </p>
<p>In conclusion, we state the explcit formula for providing the CRT answer=
 to the RSA decryption.</p>
<ul>
<img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3Dm+%5Cequiv++c%5E%7Bd_p%7D%2=
Bp+%5Ccdot+p_%7Binv%7D+%5Ccdot+%28c%5E%7Bd_q%7D-c%5E%7Bd_p%7D%29+%5C+%28%5C=
text%7Bmod%7D+%5C+p+%5Ccdot+q%29+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5=
C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%5C+%281%29&amp;bg=3Dffffff&amp;fg=3D=
333333&amp;s=3D0&amp;c=3D20201002" alt=3D"m \equiv  c^{d_p}+p \cdot p_{inv}=
 \cdot (c^{d_q}-c^{d_p}) \ (\text{mod} \ p \cdot q) \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \=
 \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ \ (1)" class=3D"latex"><p></p>
</ul>
<p>where <img src=3D"https://s0.wp.com/latex.php?latex=3Dd_p+%5Cequiv+d+%5C=
